      "heading": "B — Audience",
      "learner_facing": false,
      "markdown": "## B — Audience, Section Two Vehicle Inspection and Registration\n\nThe audience is first-time never-licensed applicants preparing for the Class C non-commercial knowledge test, reading at a plain-English level. Section Two teaches vehicle inspection, equipment, and registration rules only; it assumes no prior driving knowledge and carries no prerequisites beyond literacy. Rules progress from yearly inspection and required equipment through banned and optional gear to registration, exemptions, and newcomer duties.\n",
